// The named-escape table is conf.id's esc_chars/esc_vals; this is the linear
// search over it, the same shape as the precedence table.

// c2.id's esc_named split off its call to find_op here: naming both nested
// calls plus the result left no room in its own 3-action budget.
esc_find(int c) {
  string ch = chr(c);
  string[] ops = (import esc_chars);
  int i = find_op(ops, ch);
} return int i;
